<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52156" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰκοδαίμ-ων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>possessed by an evil genius</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				5.43
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κ. Σωκράτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					104
				</span></i>
			; <i>ill-starred</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1362
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				36.4
			</span></i>: freq. in Com., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ κακόδαιμον</span>
			<i>poor devil</i>! <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				386
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴμοι κακοδαίμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					117
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ονος ἔπαρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mort.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Deor.Conc.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. Adv.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μόνως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>evil genius</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δαίμονος δέδοιχ᾽ ὅπως μὴ τεύξομαι
					κακοδαίμονος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					112
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				4.4.38
			</span></i>.</div>
